  "translation": "Our family has three people: dad, mom, and me. My mom and I often go to this supermarket; today is Saturday and we go together, walking from home. The supermarket is on the left, with a bank on the right and a park in front; it's not far from our home. We arrived at the supermarket and first went in; there were many people inside. Mom asked me, 'Do you want to buy fruit or milk? How many apples? Which ones are good?' I said, 'Buy fruit and milk, three apples, this one is good.' We first looked at apples; one jin costs five yuan, really cheap. We bought three apples. Then we bought milk, one cup for three yuan. We also bought that bread, one for two yuan. In total, how much did we spend? Fourteen yuan. We didn't buy anything else. After returning home, Mom was cooking. The food she made was delicious. Sometimes I help wash vegetables. He also joined us for lunch together. We happily ate lunch and ate with great joy. In the afternoon, I sat on a chair in a room reading a book. In the evening, we ate dumplings again. The dumplings were the best; I ate seven. We were all very happy. The things here are very good."
